2. In this Order, unless the context otherwise requires—

"ASEAN country" means Brunei Darussalam, the Kingdom of Cambodia, Republic  of
Indonesia, Lao PDR, Malaysia, the Union of Myanmar, the Republic of the Philippines, the
Republic of Singapore, the Kingdom of Thailand and the Socialist Republic of Viet Nam, as
the case may required, and "ASEAN countries" shall be construed accordingly;

"AHTN" means ASEAN Harmonised Tariff Nomenclature;

"ATIGA" means ASEAN Trade In Goods Agreement signed on 26 February 2009;

